    'DOALL locno+' +
      LineEnding +
      'Another powerful action which allows the implementation of an ''ALL'' type command.' +
      LineEnding +
      '1 - An attempt is made to find an object at Location locno. If this is unsuccessful the DOALL is cancelled and actions NOTDONE and NEWTEXT are performed.' +
